flowchart TB
  T["Property separation: three claim-bearing witnesses<br/>not a complete pairwise lattice"]

  W1["W1: ciphertext remains retrievable;<br/>only t-1 valid dispute responses arrive by the deadline"]
  H1["CA holds"]
  F1["AD, DDL, and deadline-bounded DKA fail"]
  C1["CA does not imply DKA"]
  W1 --> H1
  W1 --> F1
  H1 -. constructive non-implication .-> C1
  F1 -. constructive non-implication .-> C1

  W2["W2: at least q_accept sampled canary responses;<br/>target-selective withholding leaves fewer than t record responses"]
  H2["AKR holds"]
  F2["Target-record AD and DDL fail"]
  C2["A passed routine audit does not unconditionally imply targeted dispute success"]
  W2 --> H2
  W2 --> F2
  H2 -. constructive non-implication .-> C2
  F2 -. constructive non-implication .-> C2

  W3["W3: two executions share the same finite audit prefix;<br/>later readiness diverges"]
  H3["Finite audit observations are identical"]
  F3["Unconditional future AD/DDL fails in one continuation"]
  C3["Finite audits do not guarantee unconditional future DKA"]
  W3 --> H3
  W3 --> F3
  H3 -. constructive non-implication .-> C3
  F3 -. constructive non-implication .-> C3

  B["Boundary: DKA is conditional and deadline-bounded;<br/>PAC and declared readiness/network assumptions remain separate obligations"]
  T --> W1
  T --> W2
  T --> W3
  C1 --> B
  C2 --> B
  C3 --> B
